onment permanently free\n- 40-minute free session for new users\n- Launch Special: $3.99 for the first month\n\n**Why It Works:** Unlike audio-only apps, Visutate uses Meta Quest's spatial computing for true immersion. Step into virtual sanctuaries and your brain naturally shifts from stress to calm.\n\n**\ud83c\udf1f IMMERSIVE SANCTUARIES:** \n- Peaceful forests with interactive wildlife\n- Underwater realms with gentle currents\n- Celestial spaces with cosmic elements\n- Breathing exercises with butterflies\n- 360\u00b0 responsive environments\n\n\ud83d\udcb0**INVEST IN YOUR MENTAL HEALTH:** Visutate helps reduce stress-related problems\n\n**Perfect For:** \n- Morning mindfulness\n- Coffee break resets\n- Evening wind-down\n- Pre-sleep relaxation\n- Anxiety relief\n- Focus enhancement\n\n**Download FREE - feel the difference in 4 minutes.**", "short_description": "Feeling overwhelmed or anxious? Transform any room into a sanctuary of calm with Meta Quest's most immersive wellness experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.visutate.com/en/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://visutate.com/en/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "Noderix Teknoloji Sanayi Ticaret AS", "support_website_url": "https://visutate.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.visutate.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE